# PROPOSED code-owners entries (a draft for the owner; NOT active: it has no effect while it sits here). GitHub reads .github/CODEOWNERS only; installing this
# is the owner's call. Replace the placeholder with the owner's login (or a team) first.
#
# Why: a DECIDED entry in the gate file, its record and the approved texts are plain repository data. The hash match in the gate
# is a tripwire against mistakes and proves no authorship (see the docstring of packaging/check-distribution-gate.py). Review by the
# owner on every change to these paths, together with the detached signatures a distribution build requires, closes that gap.
#
# Install (owner): copy the three lines below into .github/CODEOWNERS and turn on "Require review from Code Owners" for the
# protected branch.

/docs/legal/**                       REPLACE-WITH-OWNER-LOGIN
/packaging/distribution-gate.json    REPLACE-WITH-OWNER-LOGIN
/packaging/legal-allowed-signers     REPLACE-WITH-OWNER-LOGIN
